  <p>
    Renting in Dubai is a different experience from most Western countries — and the biggest
    surprise for new arrivals is usually the payment system. But once you understand how it
    works, it's straightforward. This guide walks you through everything from finding a
    property to understanding your rights as a tenant.
  </p>

